From 734ce535a963cfd0ac60c12726be2d263f761b86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:29:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Pin the i1 switch range and the dead-case phi fixes in
 PA33's regression lane

Five fixtures reduced from LowIR that chibi generates: a switch on an i1
with cases 0 and 1, and four switches with a case their root never takes,
which crashed inlining, jump threading, body compaction and value sinking.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019erWmHHnB6D36aAa4fKvwn
